        {
          "text": "Ngokufanayo, amakhosikazi asePheresiya naseMediya ayakusho namuhla kuzo zonke izikhulu zenkosi ezizwe ngesenzo sendlovukazi. Ngaleyo ndlela kuzovela ukwedelela okukhulu nentukuthelo.",
